# 🧠 12. What This Teaches You About Mental Toughness

You've already read **Can't Hurt Me**.

David Goggins emphasizes pushing through physical and psychological limits.

This book provides a different perspective.

### Goggins-style toughness:

**"I will endure the challenge."**

### The Force Behind the Forces:

**"I will continue living responsibly despite what life has taken from me."**

Both are resilience.

But they operate in different environments.

This teaches you that mental toughness isn't one single personality type.

There are **different forms of strength**.

