# 🧠 14. Gratitude Through Perspective

This book can change how you look at ordinary life.

A normal morning.

Family around you.

Someone calling you.

A friend asking how you're doing.

A peaceful commute.

These things can feel ordinary until you realize that **ordinary life itself is something many people sacrifice to protect.**

The point isn't to live in fear.

It's to develop gratitude.

### Gratitude isn't:

"Everything is perfect."

It's:

> **"I recognize the value of what I currently have."**

